{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "legend",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -280,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 210,
			"text": "**Legend**\n🟩 done · 🟨 now · ⬜ taught, not studied · 🟥 not taught yet · 🟧 shaky (see the ⚠ line)\nBuilt from the COURSE OUTLINE only (27 Oct). Leaves fill in as Korn sends each lecture's slides.\n📥 Slides in: L8 · L9 (27 Oct) · 🎥 audio: L8–L11 downloading, transcripts pending\nFiles: `~/Desktop/BA202/final/`\nEvery tax answers 5 questions: who pays · on what · how much · who's exempt · when/how it's filed"
		},
		{
			"id": "l8s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Who's in scope (s.11): three groups**\n① Thai nationality, incl. Thai juristic persons (registered in TH · >50% Thai shareholders · >50% Thai management)\n② non-Thai with a domicile in Thailand, wherever the asset is\n③ non-Thai receiving an asset SITUATED in Thailand\nthe RECIPIENT pays",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 230
		},
		{
			"id": "l8s2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**What's taxed + how it's valued (s.12, s.15)**\nimmovable property · listed securities · deposits / money · registered vehicles · others by Royal Decree\nvalue ON THE DATE RECEIVED: land = Land Code appraisal − third-party rights · listed shares = SET closing price that day · foreign currency at the Revenue Dept rate\nthen minus the liabilities taken on with it",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 220
		},
		{
			"id": "l8s3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**How much + procedure**\nonly the part ABOVE THB 100M is taxed (s.12)\n⬜ rates, reductions, exemptions, filing deadline = IMAGE slides → read in the study block\ntaxpayer: calculate → file → pay · authority: audit → collect (sanctions) → refund · appeals → Tax Court\nhistory: in 2476, repealed 2487, back via the 2015 Act",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 510,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 240
		},
		{
			"id": "l8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## L8 · Inheritance Tax (IHT)\nWed 30 Sep · Inheritance Tax Act B.E. 2558 (2015), in force 2 Feb 2016\n📥 slides: main (81 pp) + examples (21 pp, image-only)",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 295,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "l9s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Land & Building Tax** (Act B.E. 2562 / 2019) · collected by the LOCAL government\ntax = pre-assessed (appraised) value × actual rate\nuse categories + ceilings: agriculture max 0.15% · residential · other max 1.2% · empty/unused max 1.2%, +0.3% every 3 vacant years, cap 3%\nmixed use → tax in proportion · taxpayer = owner OR possessor (น.ส.3)\nassessment form within FEB · pay within APRIL · refund claim within 3 years\n⬜ residential rates + exemptions = image slides",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 290
		},
		{
			"id": "l9s2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Signboard Tax** (Act B.E. 2510 / 1967, amended 2534 / 1991) · local authorities, Ministry of Interior\ntaxed: signs for running a business or advertising · 13 exemptions\n⬜ sign types, rates, the 13 exemptions = image slides + the example set",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 1220,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## L9 · Land & Building Tax + Signboard Tax\nWed 7 Oct · 📥 slides: L&B (74 pp) · signboard (55 pp) + example (14 pp, image-only)",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 1065,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "l10s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Indirect tax: the frame**\ncollected along the chain, borne by the customer · how it differs from direct tax",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 1540,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l10s2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**VAT**\nsale of goods, services, imports · collected at every stage · output tax − input tax\n⬜ registration, rates, 0% vs exempt: waiting for the slides",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 1740,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l10",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## L10 · Indirect taxes overview + VAT\nWed 14 Oct · Revenue Code Ch. 4",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 1645,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "l11s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**SBT**\nnamed businesses instead of VAT: banking/finance, selling immovable property…\n⬜ which businesses, rates, SBT vs VAT trap: waiting for the slides",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 2060,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l11",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## L11 · Specific Business Tax (SBT)\nWed 21 Oct · Revenue Code Ch. 5",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 2065,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "l12s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Excise**\ngoods/services with health, social or environmental harm (alcohol, tobacco, sugar drinks…)\n⬜ how it's calculated: after class",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 2380,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l12",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## L12 · Excise Duty\nWed 28 Oct (TOMORROW)",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 2385,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "l13s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Customs duty**\nimports and exports",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 2700,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l13s2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Special privileges (Part I)**\ninvestment laws (BOI) · GSP · FTAs · ASEAN · EU customs union",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 2900,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l13",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## L13 · Customs Duty + Special privileges I\nWed 4 Nov · Customs Act B.E. 2560 (2017)",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 2805,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "l14s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Special privileges (Part II)**",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 3220,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l14s2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Stamp duty (Part I)**\ntax on certain legal instruments (contracts, leases, cheques…)",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 3420,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l14",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## L14 · Special privileges II + Stamp Duty I\nWed 11 Nov · Revenue Code Ch. 6",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 3325,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "l15s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Stamp duty (Part II)**",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 3740,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l15s2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Wrap-up**\ntaxation over the business life cycle · tax ethics · current issues (if time allows)",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 3940,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "l15",
