			"text": "**Resources**\nDrive (a senior's, in `~/Desktop/pastpapers/BA202/`):\n· `Tax_Final.pdf` = a senior's FINAL cheat sheet (IHT, L&B…)\n· `Taxation SheetCheat.pdf` = the indirect-tax half\nNo past final PAPER in the folder.\nHer slides: Google Classroom → Korn sends them",
